<section class="section pt-company-profile pt-about-refined" id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="pt-about-heading"><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT US <span> / </span> COMPANY PROFILE</div><p class="pt-profile-brand">PRIMA TANVRA</p><div class="pt-profile-rule"></div><h2>Indonesian Heritage.<br/><em>Modern Craft.</em></h2><p class="pt-profile-lead">A premium batik apparel brand from Indonesia, bringing the character of Indonesian textile heritage into contemporary everyday wear.</p></div><div class="pt-about-story"><div class="pt-about-label">OUR STORY</div><div class="pt-profile-copy"><p>PRIMA TANVRA brings together modern, versatile apparel and the distinctive beauty of Indonesian batik. Rather than printing the motif onto the sleeve, selected batik fabric is sewn onto the garment as a tactile design detail.</p><p>Designed for customers who value thoughtful details and cultural character, our collection is presented for international wholesale enquiries and business partnerships. We aim to make product information clear and communication direct—from sample requests to quotations and order discussions.</p></div></div><div class="pt-about-pillars"><article><span class="pt-pillar-no">01</span><h3>Indonesian Heritage</h3><p>Batik textile details that express a connection to Indonesian craft and design.</p></article><article><span class="pt-pillar-no">02</span><h3>Considered Essentials</h3><p>Clean, wearable silhouettes made to bring character to everyday styling.</p></article><article><span class="pt-pillar-no">03</span><h3>Global Outlook</h3><p>Clear product details and direct communication for international buyers.</p></article></div><div class="pt-company-identity"><span class="pt-company-label">COMPANY OPERATED BY</span><strong>PT PRIMA TANVRA INDONESIA</strong><span class="pt-company-note">Indonesia <i>·</i> Premium Batik Apparel</span></div></div></section>
